repository.description:
What the repository it works in says of itself: `link` (its `AGENTS.md`,
else `CLAUDE.md`, nearest folder first) or `none`. A feature's switch,
off when left out.

interval.description:
The scheduler's: the shortest a recurring schedule may repeat, 1m to 1d;
a model's `cron` that fires more often is refused when it's made. Link's
specification sets `"5m"`.
